            {
              "id": "normal",
              "label": "Monochrome",
              "description": "USGS mosaic on a 1 km grid; original image resolution varies from 400 m to 60 km per pixel. USGS normalized broad illumination and matched overlapping images. Photographed relief, coarse patches and some seams remain. Gray grid marks documented no-data and its resampled boundary. Added globe lighting is approximate.",
